    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 18.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif beweddodu fæmne hie forlicgge, gif hio sie cirlisc, mid LX scill gebete þam byrgean, ⁊ þæt sie on cwicæhtum feogodum, ⁊ mon nænigne mon on ðæt ne selle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a contractually betrothed woman fornicates [with someone other than her intended husband], if she is of ceorl rank, let her compensate the guarantor [to the marriage] with 60 shillings, and that must be in livestock, and no person [in servitude] can be given for that.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a young woman who is betrothed commits fornication, she shall pay compensation to the amount of 60 shillings to the surety [of the marriage], if she is a commoner. The sum shall be [paid] in livestock, cattle being the property tendered, and no leave shall be given in such payment.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif beweddod fæmne hy forlicge, gif heo sy cierlisc, mid LX scll' gebete ðam þe hit gebyrie, ⁊ ðæt sy on cwicæhtum feogodum, ⁊ mon nænigne mon on ðæt ne sylle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
